games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 865, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 447, "last_played": 1438979881, "avatar": "b0a3487ae59fbeb46950558008acc4662926b810"}, "language": "english", "review": "although the game is really flashy and seems like a solid 3rd person shooter, it becomes painfully obvious early on that there is nothing else to do but grind and grind some more. The ranking up process is ridiculous, ok so I'm not a power gamer, to be penalized with a waiting time to retry a \"rank up test\" is fine AS LONG AS IT'S NOT A REALTIME 24 HOUR WAITING PERIOD !!!! Other gripes I have with this game... 1000's of mods that can also be modded and re modded ? ok fine but can we get a little more explanation PLEASE? As for the gamer population in this game, I have to say they are like most MMO's childish, unwilling to help new people and more interested in trolling the chat than anything else. To say the game engine is flawed is an understatement ... there is barely any tutorial and if your quests \" glitch \" good luck finding a workaround, once I finished the first set of quests no other quests appeared, all there is now is \"farming\" missions. Nice try, looked like a good game but fell short really fast in terms of gameplay quality, no content to keep you playing unless all you want is another flashy bang stick to keep shooting at the same enemies all the time", "timestamp_created": 1438981163, "timestamp_updated": 1438981163, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}